OL,3,ASaudi Arabia shuts key oil pipeline
OL,4,Aafter drone attack launched from Iraq
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 1,200km (745 mile) pipeline has
OL,7,Fhelped Saudi Arabia - the world's
OL,8,Flargest crude oil exporter - bypass the
OL,9,FStrait of Hormuz.
OL,11,FThe incident comes amid a major advance
OL,12,Fby the Iranian-backed Houthi rebels in
OL,13,FYemen, putting more pressure on global
OL,14,Foil shipping routes as the US-Iran war
OL,15,Fstretches into its seventh month.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
